{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-14_beg",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-14",
  "title": "'We'",
  "storyCode": "13-16",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-14_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "09437c69496a4cd739eaf3ecf0bf8e2d57b5a483c71c245366a621747f91ad49",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Good news? Or bad news?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Red",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The good news is that the workshop is still intact, the forest hid it good. The dukes and the Sarkaz never got to use it as an outpost."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Red",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The bad news is, someone's living there. We saw lights. I walked up, identified myself, and the lights went out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Might be refugees or deserters."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But they put out the lights... that means they're wary of us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Warrior",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Our fighters are ready for anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, let's not be hasty. They might just be cautious, or fearful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't jump to conclusions."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And anyway, Red's carrying a pretty long blade. Anyone would want to play it safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why don't I go? I'll have a word with them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "By yourself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's enough. The more men we send, the more nervous they'll be. Besides, if they mean us harm, a few more hands won't make a difference."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The sky to the south has been red for the past few days. Percival and the others even found an Arts Circle..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We need to move fast."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's some risk in that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But we made it out of Chernobog."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Fair enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We'll be ready to provide support on the sidelines, to make a breakthrough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This place was some kind of distillery before the Victorian Reunion settled in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I can already smell the booze. Romanich would've loved it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hello. Anybody home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hi, I'm Guard. I've got a team nearby, I'm pretty sure you saw them earlier?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't worry, we mean no harm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Victorian Reunion used to use this workshop to make medicine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It brought hope to a lot of Infected around Londinium. Its medicine even circulated among the workers in the sewers below the city's industrial districts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Whoever you are, you know the war is turning a lot more people Infected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We want to get things going again here, to help them."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Since you're occupying the place...\nWe need your cooperation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We can provide medicine or other supplies. We'll trade fair."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion?",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Reunion, you said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your clothes... who are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion?",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mays."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Come in."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Look away, and clear out."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you in charge here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This place is under my control."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's find a place to talk."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Here we are. Nobody comes in here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So you're Reunion, the real Reunion. You came from the north?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "From... Ursus?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, Ursus, Columbia, and now we're in Victoria."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's a ways."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your uniform, it's..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I... used a bedsheet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I ran into a group from Ursus before. They said you dress like this. I think I got the emblem right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Looks a bit big."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Did you come here just to mock my handiwork?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So you control this place just because you dressed up in the garb of the infamous 'Reunion'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's get to the point. I don't have much time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You want to get this place up and running again? To start making medicine?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, if news got out that Reunion is running the place again..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Things are more complicated than you know. We have all kinds of people here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm worn out breaking up the daily fights between Infected and uninfected. And you want to make Infected medicine? You might as well blow the place up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's hard to keep a balance between them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're Reunion, aren't you? At least, you claim to be."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "More or less."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who are your people?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What else would they be? Homeless Infected, war refugees, people who have lost everything. We all need a roof over our heads."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I first came here with a few other Infected. We found this ruin."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Later, more people came, including some... less than honest folk. We don't take anyone else in anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm glad to see you, Reunion comrades, but I don't want to worry anyone here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Worry?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That you're conspiring with us to wipe out the uninfected in our midst."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Whether or not it's just a pretext to get us to open our doors to you, we can trade supplies. But let's leave it at that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There are plenty of uninfected here, so I get what you're saying."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I still think it would be a good idea to talk it over with your people before you come to a decision. As long as we can get back to making medicine here, we can come to a long-term agreement—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, no thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now, off with you. It was nice meeting you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you want to take this place, you're welcome to it. So long as you <i>can</i> take it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright then."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey, Reunion!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is Talulah with your group?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...She is."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I hear she has a nomadic city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Does that city of hers only take Infected?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you haven't been infected, are you allowed to go there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've heard... from the passing caravans, I've heard it's a nice place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We—There's some people here in less-than-ideal positions, refugees from the wilderness, orphans without a single relative. Talk of that Reunion city has everyone full of hope."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But... you only stand with the Infected, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A... city?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There might be a misunderstanding here—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mays! Do you know what they did?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Did you tell them to do it?! Have you gone mad?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They—Those idiots!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "He might've been a fighter in the war here! Or some big important figure, here to doom us all!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We might be just a couple hours out from a battalion of Sarkaz coming in here to wipe us out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You... Are you with Reunion, like Mays?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It was you, your people—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Those Infected, they killed a Sarkaz in the warehouse!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Bollocks!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "He... He was Infected too... He's going to explode, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "speakerToken": null,
